{"id":"658305","name":"盐焗鸡腿","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658305/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄桅子","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿洗净备用。","img":"images/658305/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡皮用开水烫过后再倒出水。","img":"images/658305/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入姜片。","img":"images/658305/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入一包盐焗粉和适量花生油。","img":"images/658305/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉抓均匀后放置一小时以上入味。","img":"images/658305/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里放入香葱结。","img":"images/658305/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鸡腿。","img":"images/658305/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入一两个黄栀子。","img":"images/658305/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/658305/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上大火煮开后转小火焖。","img":"images/658305/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"中途给鸡腿翻翻面，焖二十分钟左右后收汁。","img":"images/658305/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"焖好的鸡腿可以晾凉斩块。","img":"images/658305/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658305/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658305/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：焖烧锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}